# =====================================================================
# Foundational design/engineering docs — kept local, not committed.
# These reference internal product strategy and aesthetic comparisons.
# The repo's public surface is README.md + code.
#
# Patterns use [Mm][Dd] so the rule survives case-sensitive filesystems
# (Linux CI) as well as macOS's case-insensitive APFS. A file tracked
# under one casing (e.g. AGENTS.MD) wouldn't be matched by a different-
# casing pattern on Linux, which is how AGENTS.MD slipped into the
# public history once already.
# =====================================================================
PHILOSOPHY.[Mm][Dd]
DESIGN.[Mm][Dd]
ENGINEERING.[Mm][Dd]
CLAUDE.[Mm][Dd]
AGENTS.[Mm][Dd]
todo.[Mm][Dd]
TODO.[Mm][Dd]
TODOs.[Mm][Dd]
TODOS.[Mm][Dd]

